## ⚡ GSI & Treble Compatibility Realities

While the device supports Project Treble and dynamic partitioning, **Treble support alone does not guarantee that a Generic System Image (GSI) or custom system build will boot or be usable**. 

Key considerations for MediaTek Samsung hardware:
- **Vendor Dependencies**: MediaTek display drivers, audio HALs, camera services, and radio interface layers (RIL) rely on OEM-specific vendor libraries.
- **Hardware Abstraction Mismatches**: A generic or Pixel-inspired system image may fail to boot or experience critical hardware failure (loss of touchscreen, cellular network, audio, or graphics acceleration) if vendor binaries do not align exactly with system interfaces.

